ts experience was reduced from 26,000 to 22,100 and its loot in 5% with the balancing changes on April 15, 2021.</li>\n<li>Its experience was further reduced to 19,450 with the changes on June 01, 2021.</li>\n<li>Its experience was later decreased to 15,560 on July 06, 2021. Its loot was decreased by 10% on the same patch.</li>\n<li>On February 01, 2022, its experience was increased to 17,430 while its loot was increased by 8%.</li>\n<li>As announced on August 26, 2025, the patch decreased its gold gain by 8%.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 240 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Crystal Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Coin_55f849.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.49</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"49.166667\" style=\"text-align:center;\">49%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.26</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"25.833333\" style=\"text-align:center;\">26%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" t